{"id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-satisfaction.md","title":"结构赋值下的满足关系","display":"df-satisfaction — 结构赋值下的满足关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-satisfaction","aliases":["20-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — 结构赋值下的满足关系","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 的逻辑背景；本地 Tarski 递归展开","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — 结构赋值下的满足关系"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 的逻辑背景；本地 Tarski 递归展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=(D,(f^\\mathfrak M)_{f\\in F},(r^\\mathfrak M)_{r\\in R})\">\\(\\mathfrak M=(D,(f^\\mathfrak M)_{f\\in F},(r^\\mathfrak M)_{r\\in R})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(D\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^\\mathfrak M:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\">\\(f^\\mathfrak M:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r^\\mathfrak M\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\">\\(r^\\mathfrak M\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to D\">\\(\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\llbracket v\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M:=\\beta(v),\\quad\n\\llbracket(f,(t_i))\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M:=\nf^\\mathfrak M((\\llbracket t_i\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M)_i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(=,t,u)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M=\\llbracket u\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(r,(t_i))[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\llbracket t_i\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M)_i\\in r^\\mathfrak M,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\neg,\\phi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n((\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi[\\beta])),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\forall,v,\\phi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta[v\\mapsto d]]].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\llbracket v\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M:=\\beta(v),\\quad\n\\llbracket(f,(t_i))\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M:=\nf^\\mathfrak M((\\llbracket t_i\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M)_i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(=,t,u)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M=\\llbracket u\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(r,(t_i))[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\llbracket t_i\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M)_i\\in r^\\mathfrak M,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\neg,\\phi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n((\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi[\\beta])),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\forall,v,\\phi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta[v\\mapsto d]]].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里右侧否定、蕴含与量词属于元语言，左侧是按有限公式结构递归定义的对象满足关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[v\\mapsto d]\">\\(\\beta[v\\mapsto d]\\)</span> 只改变 v 的值。句子满足与赋值无关。可证与满足是不同关系，不能互作无条件缩写。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1 的逻辑背景；本地 Tarski 递归展开；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=(D,(f^\\mathfrak M)_{f\\in F},(r^\\mathfrak M)_{r\\in R})","display":false},{"tex":"D\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"f^\\mathfrak M:D^{a_F(f)}\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"r^\\mathfrak M\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\llbracket v\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M:=\\beta(v),\\quad\n\\llbracket(f,(t_i))\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M:=\nf^\\mathfrak M((\\llbracket t_i\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M)_i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(=,t,u)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M=\\llbracket u\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(r,(t_i))[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\llbracket t_i\\rrbracket_\\beta^\\mathfrak M)_i\\in r^\\mathfrak M,\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\neg,\\phi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n((\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi[\\beta])),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\forall,v,\\phi)[\\beta]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall d\\in D\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta[v\\mapsto d]]].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta[v\\mapsto d]","display":false}],"bytes":2056,"backlinks":[{"id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。"},{"id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"a6a902146de6a471","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。"}],"outgoing":["0c35680c0004f5e2"]}